  "status": "experimental-public-api-not-conformance-evidence",
  "notes": "A federate subscribes to two adapter-selected attributes on one ordinary, dimensionless application object class, then invokes the distinct IEEE 1516.1-2025 whole-class unsubscribe service. A separate requester uses standard HLArequestSubscriptions and verifies the IEEE 1516.2-2025 MIM zero-class NULL response. No DDM declarations, region services, vendor API, private headers, or non-standard dependencies are used. Provider, FOMs, endpoint, callback model, object class, and attribute names are adapter configured.",
